
### Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@bookId = 2

### 0. Login as ADMIN and save JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("userAccessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 1. Get current cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 2. Add one copy of a book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 3. Add another copy of the same book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 4. Get cart after adding books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 5. Remove one copy
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 6. Remove the remaining copy
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 7. Remove a book that is not in the cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 8. Get empty cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 9. Try adding a nonexistent book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 10. Try accessing cart without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart


### 11. Add book for archive scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 12. Archive book (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}


### 13. Get cart after archiving
# Archived book should be removed automatically
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 14. Try adding archived book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}


### 15. Restore book (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
